---
interface Item { href: string; label: string; }
interface Props { items: Item[]; }
const { items } = Astro.props;
---
<aside class="safety-gate" aria-labelledby="safety-gate-title">
  <h2 id="safety-gate-title">動手修改前，先花一分鐘確認</h2>
  <ul>{items.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a></li>)}</ul>
  <p>這不是測驗，也不會擋下操作。多看這幾眼，可以省下事後補救的麻煩。</p>
</aside>
